          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n        Ef 5:22—6:9.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagore, mugamburukire abagabo banyu, nk’uko bibereye abari mu Mwami wacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.3.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 3:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagabo, mukunde abagore banyu, ntimubabere umururazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bana, mwumvire abavyeyi banyu muri vyose, kukw ivyo ari vyo bishimwa mu Mwami wacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba se, ntimukaratse abana banyu, ngo ntibaranduke imitima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagurano, mwumvire ba shobuja bo ku mubiri muri vyose, atar’ iyo babahagarikiye gusa, nk’abanezereza abantu, ariko mubakorere mutagira ubupfunya mu mitima yanyu, mwubaha Shobuja mukuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivyo mukora vyose, mubikore bivuye mu mutima, nk’abakorera Shobuja mukuru, ntimube nk’abakorera abantu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muzi yuko muzohabga impēra na Shobuja mukuru, ni yo wa mwandu. Shobuja uwo Kristo ni we mukorera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
